Party Nearly Wiped and Then Everything Went Downhill","description":"**“—N-No!? Wolka, don’t die—!!”**\n\nWolka is an adventurer reincarnated from Japan. While exploring a dungeon, he and his party are attacked by an overwhelmingly powerful monster. In order to protect his companions, Wolka suffers critical injuries and is pushed to the brink of death.\n\nAt that very moment, he finally realizes the truth:\nThis world is the dark fantasy manga he once read in his previous life—and he himself is nothing more than a background character, fated to die along with the rest of the party.\n\nHating bad endings more than anything else, Wolka refuses to accept that fate. Driven by sheer desperation, he fights with everything he has and, against all odds, miraculously defeats the monster. Though he loses one eye and one leg in the process, Wolka feels relieved for having overturned the “party annihilation” ending that was supposed to await him.\n\nBut his troubles are far from over.\n\nSince that incident, the girls in his party begin to change.\nTheir gazes grow unbearably heavy.\nTheir words become increasingly dangerous.\n\n“I’ll protect you this time, so please don’t leave me...”\n“I’ll always stay by your side, senior—okay?”\n“I’ve already decided... if it’s for your sake, I’m ready to die.”\n\n\n\nThis is an isekai story about a reincarnator who believes in absolute happy endings—and the girls who harbor overwhelmingly obsessive feelings toward him.\nA darkly emotional otherworld tale themed around 【Emotional Descent】, where the survival he fought so desperately to achieve becomes the very beginning of emotional darkness.","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f70e8da7-e6b2-4fb6-bd19-192906137c87/c933348a-2c14-46be-905c-222aa1334554.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["id","pt-br","vi","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.49,"follows":64750,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:57:16.517Z","chapters":[{"id":"ba91ec16-bb4b-479e-aad8-95e6be53149d","number":"9","volume":null,"title":"The Morning of Departure ","lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-09-15T14:41:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"801d97e9-c522-48bd-a6e6-67f829388c32","number":"8.1","volume":null,"title":"Atri","lang":"id","pages":18,"createdAt":"2026-07-13T09:00:31+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"aacd3cc5-4f81-48f5-b95a-48981b9f7303","number":"8","volume":null,"title":"Atri","lang":"en","pages":26,"createdAt":"2026-09-11T12:58:23+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"65506339-4824-4fa5-8128-1ebdd1a656f4","number":"7.2","volume":null,"title":"Quest Yang Mencurigakan","lang":"id","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-06-25T11:14:51+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a44cc471-3ba7-4648-943c-c6d8c9aff55e","number":"7.1","volume":null,"title":"Quest Yang Mencurigakan","lang":"id","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-06-11T03:14:29+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bd5c4e1d-7b65-4bc7-ad1c-24136e9ac36f","number":"7","volume":null,"title":"An Ominous Quest","lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-08-24T14:17:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fbdb8f26-dbc8-406c-868d-872842ab99ee","number":"6.2","volume":null,"title":"Lizel Arte ","lang":"id","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:15:28+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"405bc97c-2ff4-4551-9e47-c78d2bd17947","number":"6.1","volume":null,"title":"Lizel Arte","lang":"id","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-05-14T05:40:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ac9a4861-8b04-48d1-bd2e-a5377f204c20","number":"6","volume":null,"title":"Lizelarte","lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-06-11T18:19:32+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"516a13c9-ac86-4f56-938a-2ca371a8fecb","number":"5.3","volume":"1","title":"Ilustrasi Edisi Libur","lang":"id","pages":5,"createdAt":"2026-04-08T03:58:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5c4cafd7-de11-4ba9-bfeb-0fc89d74774e","number":"5.2","volume":"1","title":"Penyesalan","lang":"id","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-03-26T03:03:39+